{"id": "8e88481e-420a-485f-9170-0e8271963222", "slug": "pipeline-architecture", "title": "Pipeline Architecture", "description": "Pipeline Architecture UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Pipeline Architecture\"\ndescription: \"Pipeline Architecture UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#22D3EE\"\n  secondary: \"#050505\"\n  accent: \"#22D3EE\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"15px\"\n  control: \"15px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Pipeline Architecture\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 3; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: ui, css, interactive, dashboard, app, interface.\n## Overview\nPipeline Architecture UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\n/// Synthesis Engine Frictionless translation from idea to interface Define Logic Input structural requirements and core objectives using plain-text parameters. Generate Topology The engine processes logic to construct…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Frictionless translation from idea to interface; Define Logic; Generate Topology; Iterative Refinement; Core Architecture & Data Visualization.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #22D3EE, secondary #050505, accent #22D3EE, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Playfair Display for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Pipeline Architecture</title>\n\n    <!-- Dependencies -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-cyan-900/50 selection:text-cyan-100\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-40 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-32 pb-40 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12\">\n\n        <!-- Directive: Container Lines & Mini Squares -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-4 sm:left-6 lg:left-12 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-neutral-800/60 to-transparent pointer-events-none hidden md:block\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-neutral-700 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/4 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-neutral-700 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 right-4 sm:right-6 lg:right-12 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-neutral-800/60 to-transparent pointer-events-none hidden md:block\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/3 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-neutral-700 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-1/3 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-neutral-700 bg-[#050505]\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <div class=\"text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-24 md:mb-32 relative\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-cyan-500 tracking-[0.2em] mb-6 uppercase font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">/// Synthesis Engine</p>\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5rem] leading-[1.05] text-neutral-100 font-geist font-light tracking-tight\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">\n                Frictionless translation<br>from idea to interface\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20 relative mx-auto max-w-5xl\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Timeline Stepper -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 relative mt-8\">\n                <!-- Vertical Track Lines -->\n                <div class=\"absolute left-[11px] top-3 bottom-6 w-[1px] bg-neutral-800/50\"></div>\n                <!-- Active Track Highlight -->\n                <div class=\"absolute left-[11px] top-3 h-[30%] w-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-400 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(34,211,238,0.5)] z-10\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-20 relative z-20\">\n\n                    <!-- Step 1: Active -->\n                    <div class=\"relative pl-12 group\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-[8px] w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#050505]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(34,211,238,0.8)]\" style=\"border-radius: 1px;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl text-neutral-100 tracking-tight mb-2 font-normal font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">Define Logic</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light font-geist\">Input structural requirements and core objectives using plain-text parameters.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Step 2: Inactive -->\n                    <div class=\"relative pl-12 opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100 group cursor-default\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-[8px] w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#050505]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-neutral-700 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-neutral-500\" style=\"border-radius: 1px;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl text-neutral-100 tracking-tight mb-2 font-normal font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">Generate Topology</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light font-geist\">The engine processes logic to construct high-fidelity mockups and content structures.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Step 3: Inactive -->\n                    <div class=\"relative pl-12 opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100 group cursor-default\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-[8px] w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#050505]\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-neutral-700 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-neutral-500\" style=\"border-radius: 1px;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl text-neutral-100 tracking-tight mb-2 font-normal font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">Iterative Refinement</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed font-light font-geist\">Manipulate output via contextual actions to expand detail, change tone, or optimize flow.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: UI Mockups -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-12\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: Input -->\n                <!-- Directive: Border Gradients -->\n                <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-700/40 via-neutral-800/10 to-neutral-900/30 p-[1px] shadow-2xl\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-[15px] bg-[#0A0A0B] p-6 sm:p-10 min-h-[280px] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Inner ambient light -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-1/2 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-cyan-500/20 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start text-neutral-300 text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed relative z-10\">\n                            <span class=\"font-geist\">Construct a minimalist analytics dashboard focusing on real-time user engagement metrics</span>\n                            <span id=\"cursor-blink\" class=\"inline-block w-[2px] h-[1.2em] bg-cyan-400 ml-1 translate-y-[2px]\"></span>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-end mt-8 relative z-10\">\n                            <button class=\"bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-neutral-950 text-sm font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-2 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(34,211,238,0.15)] hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(34,211,238,0.3)] font-geist\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-3-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                                Synthesize\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: Output Draft -->\n                <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-800/30 via-neutral-900/10 to-[#050505] p-[1px] shadow-2xl\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-[15px] bg-[#0A0A0B] p-6 sm:p-8 overflow-hidden\">\n\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-read-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-cyan-500 text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tracking-wide font-geist\">Topology compiled for \"Analytics Dashboard\":</p>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"bg-[#0F0F11] border border-neutral-800/50 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-inner shadow-black/20\">\n                            <h4 class=\"text-xl text-neutral-100 font-medium mb-4 tracking-tight font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\">Core Architecture &amp; Data Visualization</h4>\n                            <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 font-light font-geist\">\n                                To ensure cognitive ease, the dashboard must prioritize high-level trends over granular data tables upon initial load. The layout utilizes progressive disclosure techniques.\n                            </p>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-5\">\n                                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-cyan-500 text-xs mt-0.5 font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">01</span>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <p class=\"text-neutral-200 text-sm font-medium font-geist\">Real-time Activity Graph</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs mt-1 font-light font-geist\">Dynamic spline chart showing concurrent users with 5-second polling.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-cyan-500 text-xs mt-0.5 font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">02</span>\n                                    <div>\n                                        <p class=\"text-neutral-200 text-sm font-medium font-geist\">Engagement Heatmap</p>\n                                        <p class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs mt-1 font-light font-geist\">Visual representation of feature interaction intensity over a 24-hour period.</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3: Refinement Tools -->\n                <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-800/30 via-neutral-900/10 to-[#050505] p-[1px] shadow-2xl\">\n                    <div class=\"relative rounded-[15px] bg-[#0A0A0B] p-6 sm:p-10 min-h-[380px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-center\">\n\n                        <!-- Background Document Text -->\n                        <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-lg sm:text-xl leading-[1.8] font-light opacity-40 select-none blur-[0.5px] font-geist\">\n                            When constructing the data visualizations, <span class=\"bg-cyan-900/30 text-cyan-200 px-1 rounded-sm border-b border-cyan-800/50 font-geist\">prioritize high-level trends over granular data tables</span> upon initial load. The layout utilizes progressive disclosure techniques to ensure users are not overwhelmed. This approach significantly reduces cognitive load and improves daily active usage metrics across the platform.\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Directive: Floating Context Menu -->\n                        <div id=\"floating-menu\" class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-8 w-[260px] sm:w-[280px] bg-[#121214] border border-neutral-700/50 rounded-xl shadow-[0_25px_50px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden z-20\">\n\n                            <!-- Search Input -->\n                            <div class=\"p-2 border-b border-neutral-800/80\">\n                                <div class=\"bg-[#0A0A0B] rounded-lg flex items-center px-3 py-2 border border-neutral-800 focus-within:border-cyan-500/40 transition-colors\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Command...\" class=\"bg-transparent border-none outline-none text-sm text-neutral-200 ml-2 w-full placeholder-neutral-600 font-light\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Action List -->\n                            <div class=\"p-1.5 flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                                <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800/60 transition-colors text-left group\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-new-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300 group-hover:text-neutral-100 transition-colors font-geist\">Adjust professional tone</span>\n                                </button>\n\n                                <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-cyan-950/30 border border-cyan-900/50 text-left\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-cyan-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm text-cyan-100 font-medium font-geist\">Expand technical detail</span>\n                                    <span class=\"ml-auto flex gap-1\">\n                                        <kbd class=\"bg-[#050505] text-neutral-400 px-1.5 py-[1px] rounded text-[10px] border border-neutral-800 font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">⌘</kbd>\n                                        <kbd class=\"bg-[#050505] text-neutral-400 px-1.5 py-[1px] rounded text-[10px] border border-neutral-800 font-geist\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">E</kbd>\n                                    </span>\n                                </button>\n\n                                <button class=\"w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-neutral-800/60 transition-colors text-left group\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:minimize-square-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-400 group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                                    <span class=\"text-sm text-neutral-300 group-hover:text-neutral-100 transition-colors font-geist\">Condense paragraph</span>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Interaction and WebGL -->\n    <script>\n        // DOM Animations\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Blinking cursor\n            const cursor = document.getElementById('cursor-blink');\n            setInterval(() => {\n                cursor.style.opacity = cursor.style.opacity === '0' ? '1' : '0';\n            }, 530);\n\n            // Floating menu animation\n            const menu = document.getElementById('floating-menu');\n            let startTime = Date.now();\n\n            function animateMenu() {\n                const elapsed = Date.now() - startTime;\n                // Subtle sine wave movement on Y axis\n                const yOffset = Math.sin(elapsed * 0.002) * 6;\n                menu.style.transform = `translateY(${yOffset}px)`;\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateMenu);\n            }\n            animateMenu();\n        });\n\n        // Directive: WebGL 3D Object implementation\n        function initWebGL() {\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n\n            // Scene setup\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            // Optional: Fog to blend into background\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x050505, 0.02);\n\n            // Camera setup\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 25;\n            camera.position.y = 5;\n\n            // Renderer setup\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n            container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n            // Directive: Geometric mesh with physically-based material\n            // Icosahedron with detail 0 gives a nice faceted low-poly look\n            const geometry = new THREE.IcosahedronGeometry(8, 0);\n\n            const material = new THREE.MeshPhysicalMaterial({\n                color: 0x0a0a0a,\n                emissive: 0x000000,\n                roughness: 0.2,      // Shiny surface\n                metalness: 0.8,      // Metallic look\n                flatShading: true,   // Crucial for edges to catch light\n                clearcoat: 0.1,\n                wireframe: false\n            });\n\n            const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n            mesh.position.set(10, 2, -5); // Position slightly off-center right\n            scene.add(mesh);\n\n            // Secondary smaller mesh\n            const geo2 = new THREE.OctahedronGeometry(3, 0);\n            const mesh2 = new THREE.Mesh(geo2, material);\n            mesh2.position.set(-15, 8, -10);\n            scene.add(mesh2);\n\n            // Directive: Real lighting (Directional + Ambient)\n            const ambientLight = new THREE.AmbientLight(0xffffff, 0.2);\n            scene.add(ambientLight);\n\n            // Cyan main directional light to match theme\n            const dirLight1 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x22d3ee, 3);\n            dirLight1.position.set(10, 20, 10);\n            scene.add(dirLight1);\n\n            // Deep blue fill light\n            const dirLight2 = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0x1e3a8a, 4);\n            dirLight2.position.set(-10, -10, 10);\n            scene.add(dirLight2);\n\n            // Soft white backlight\n            const backLight = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 1);\n            backLight.position.set(0, 0, -20);\n            scene.add(backLight);\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Rotation\n                mesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.1;\n                mesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.15;\n\n                mesh2.rotation.x = elapsedTime * -0.2;\n                mesh2.rotation.y = elapsedTime * -0.1;\n\n                // Floating motion\n                mesh.position.y = 2 + Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.5) * 1.5;\n                mesh2.position.y = 8 + Math.cos(elapsedTime * 0.7) * 1;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Responsive handling\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        }\n\n        // Initialize WebGL once script is loaded\n        if (typeof THREE !== 'undefined') {\n            initWebGL();\n        }\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "pipeline-architecture.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/pipeline-architecture.jpg", "source_name": "pipeline-architecture-DESIGN.md", "views": 46, "forks": 0, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:42:31.951899+00:00"}